{"job_id":"F-44797e2c2a87b87aaf24","family_id":"F-44797e2c2a87b87aaf24","title":"군표창규정","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":5,"target_id":"2824a5fcc0b4f4cb016726dd56c0979062489fbb23f6c3fc95dda7fe4cff139e","source_hash":"3b47cbf25575c9bc69c1ad3fe55aab7bc311af105bc688252144a10b54da0bc9","text":"军事嘉奖条例"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":60,"target_id":"0a6d9e8909604f8969d3da8305b67f940091e28c41396dbe18f85ec1a6ac5757","source_hash":"7db0ea40e9dd1f138aa567973b8686dd6a43bceeaf34f26a5771eb7e3218ab07","text":"第一条（目的）本法令的目的是表彰那些因在履行军事职责中表现出优异功绩而成为他人榜样的人。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":60,"end":127,"target_id":"841817433b9eaaec3d0f3faa2d86b9f8424aca77f02a00e56e19452b908a9137","source_hash":"3eb25d38a49f5d29697165826d109a85380e9c0c992b3110cca7cab03e3aa738","text":"第二条（嘉奖种类） 嘉奖种类如下。\n1. 成就奖\n2。荣誉奖\n3。删除<2017.9.19>\n4. 合作奖\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":127,"end":383,"target_id":"119e085f100ae5c800a36be4a97a3e5a53c8ea0ff3a2ec4b203181ee1feb616a","source_hash":"3d9558b2cc1e9e8581000b51dfcc79f875b97217108d27967736df37d6b559fd","text":"第三条（功绩奖励）\n① 对为军队做出重大贡献的单位、军人、文职人员、预备役人员以及与国防部有关联的人员（包括国防部机关、直属机关、直属单位；以下同上）应授予功绩奖；但单位应授予单位嘉奖，军人、文职人员、预备役人员以及与国防部有关联的人员应授予个人嘉奖。\n② 尽管有第1款的规定，国防部长可以向对军事服务做出重大贡献的公职人员和平民颁发个人嘉奖证书。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":383,"end":524,"target_id":"416739ca1caaf2fa08f1356cc83df35bfedfe1540a5ca00111499c62ebae83b3","source_hash":"e62f4337c16b7bfd20e658fe6462acf6a300238f8f52c517654cc3f5d84ecece","text":"第四条（优秀奖）优秀奖应当授予在军事教育期间品行端正、学业优异，堪为他人榜样的个人、单位、公职机关、组织或个人，或者在政府机关或军队举办的各种军事相关竞赛中取得优异成绩的个人，并授予其荣誉证书。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":524,"end":544,"target_id":"e5904e7a0469b10266c7d4d2e05198a9a3ab087afd17af53665984e42d42a614","source_hash":"5428bb3524df8c6615ec1bb6e883d3445ab9617ff021b45cba9437e260a2aceb","text":"删除第 5 条 <2017.9.19>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":544,"end":656,"target_id":"c1d0b22f26c9172325beaf48f968d6ba0e13572f519f7d63add0edf238698822","source_hash":"99d4f1e7f198ce56a2353f6eb30d56ae1c2d7483e7c874f207b985ca0da7b064","text":"第六条（合作奖） 凡积极配合军队并取得突出功绩的军人、文职军人、公务员、平民或外国人，均应获颁合作奖，并颁发感谢状。<1992年12月31日修订；2023年3月21日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":656,"end":949,"target_id":"679420ed8d5fac0e828556f3cb206dbe2ae816fe0010123a3926789ae67a1dc6","source_hash":"06244b69630c123f51cdc7aaf572242eb0baaf2cb592a49c6e90a2f6a6f3ad15","text":"第七条（授予权）\n① 嘉奖证书和奖励由总统、总理、国防部长、参谋长联席会议主席、各军种参谋长以及国防部条例指定的单位和部门负责人颁发。<1992年12月31日修订，2017年9月19日修订>\n② 删除 <2017.9.19>\n③ 嘉奖证书由国防部长、参谋长联席会议主席、各军种参谋长以及国防部条例指定的各单位和部门负责人颁发。<1992年12月31日修订，2017年9月19日修订>\n④ 总统和总理根据第1款规定颁发的表彰证书，应按照《政府表彰条例》执行。<1992年12月31日修订，2013年1月16日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":949,"end":1021,"target_id":"9f54b346266599168e32edaf46de1d809b3f869467cddcd6eb2593bcdd5b1cce","source_hash":"ad91820314c1e46110cdd9f7e9359c34a56573f22fadcb8217f6adaa5f933750","text":"第 8 条（表彰建议）根据本法令，要授予表彰时，应当通过指挥链向表彰机关提出建议，具体说明表彰的理由。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1021,"end":1100,"target_id":"9919b41e2d42f01bb70834c9429f64e914119e4f5eaf1bc8e107cd9714f8eb16","source_hash":"c66c8293b7ed9c61a48b17b365c03ac96a43eaa18e2f2b44a13967614656a89f","text":"第九条（嘉奖和奖励的颁发时间）嘉奖应当按照国防部条例的规定定期或不定期颁发，并可同时颁发奖金或奖励。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1100,"end":1262,"target_id":"43a57c680cc145057f92d5819d53d077ea6fb6f2df4d6b741671d3bce091a9c3","source_hash":"021c7b766d56c07138bfa5a1d734029df9324dcea10a736f9fe4ff5dfb789e9b","text":"第十条（功绩审查委员会）\n① 根据第七条规定，各颁奖机构应在其管辖范围内设立评奖委员会，负责审查表彰候选人。<1992年12月31日修订，2017年9月19日修订>\n② 公众审查委员会由五至十名成员组成，其中一名为主席。\n③主席和成员由授奖机构任命。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1262,"end":1310,"target_id":"121df8e228a7971cd5e75e06d3a7a01a885e7ed83ad50b54f96e0bb190176f73","source_hash":"26d0eeda68e5dfb642d4c792225026f3f67d63d2cbac3e8a77c28783573ac1e0","text":"第 11 条（禁止重复表彰）对同一功绩不得给予两次表彰。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1310,"end":1381,"target_id":"a574ab198b53014a6011560a63fd725306f909f6afbbe020f795545af5d6dfda","source_hash":"45596102aa96744d996561b4ca6a691db7f27f9aceebee450c446b22202a4159","text":"第十二条（对嘉奖的限制）国防部长认为有必要保持各军种嘉奖的平衡时，可以确定嘉奖的比例。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1381,"end":1536,"target_id":"1fec5ea39b0326a5c27dd9cf69b54cbf4eefdd3636dae9be3be24869113b9a87","source_hash":"0714b23924219ce4721c01cf9f6357950d2f6dd0d1dfd2670a48ef3eaae90867","text":"第十三条（追授）\n① 如获奖者在领取奖项前去世，则应将相关嘉奖证书、奖项或感谢信颁发给其遗属。<2017年9月19日修订>\n② 根据第1款规定有权享受丧葬服务的家属范围和顺序，应当按照《军人家属丧葬服务条例》第2条的规定执行。<1992年12月31日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1536,"end":1601,"target_id":"49e9ae44d9bc3af6da483686877014b81ca015eac5f08b05e6f9f3d03a29cbe8","source_hash":"cb19a583575a9610a49ec48a5f768e2c4b793b3a51f7dc0c959520b276f96204","text":"第十四条（撤销表彰）表彰不得撤销。但是，如果表彰所依据的功绩被认定为虚假，则应当撤销表彰。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1601,"end":1622,"target_id":"11bce240a2b7307320147529963b06139cca5c004a61ee910c30b645f078eb41","source_hash":"0e921b43dcffc9d576eaa9bcd30f9fad8e8ecf58acc319693006e01f4a8494b9","text":"删除第 15 条 <2017.9.19>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1622,"end":1665,"target_id":"36a33bf43dac629f72178cbfc1490db41f85a807fcf6f5c1d509a771e5b13b41","source_hash":"b4b5af78fa7c8c418d24c8e200cf5a60ab5369dce81074b82ac05919a991230d","text":"补充规定 <第4882号，1970年4月9日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1665,"end":1710,"target_id":"8bd6656b8a840b11797e3bfb3719d1a4ce892185d0fd914ff77e8e8c50766292","source_hash":"0242adb2a18008ab9eca927e2616e448625c936f2751f5ec5080e04d9f370ac8","text":"补充规定 <第13809号，1992年12月31日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1710,"end":1743,"target_id":"bf620e7ad9938d5bcd2707f8bf3c6379c3eb5024bb0d68b979e608426030ea2f","source_hash":"18c90ba24de9f43239cb3d300b368bd05e8c7b4b3162b9a7eb4dfe30db41d481","text":"附录（《军事人员法》实施令》）<第17158号，2001年3月27日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1743,"end":1779,"target_id":"e2bda9d683b70173609140b784cffaa892e993dc52865907794a4a5d9a32521a","source_hash":"617dbde7bc51be4bbcf36a495559ca6082322d7be15909b476c451fca4e92c69","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2001年3月27日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1779,"end":1877,"target_id":"7d76d6e5f536729f1657a3b0856538f351473d5f9e9903c62cd9a6caad98dc88","source_hash":"9a45199299099aad9513cb64c872d57b8941ea45ec4b5fe4f0e0cf7b04927a02","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①至<17> 已省略\n\n  <18> 《军事嘉奖条例》修订如下。\n\n  第 5 条中的“非委任军官”应改为“非委任军官”。\n\n  <19> 至 <25> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1877,"end":1885,"target_id":"97dc924ffccb503cf57b4be8dce73f397c81e871ef2b47881263d79dd7ea8116","source_hash":"fab18bd1e0d74a271eea817ca2d5dff62d53ec4d5214a8c48af3c4adbab54a93","text":"第3条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1885,"end":1919,"target_id":"e46ddb6239de5a6b10e847b8a5d72145eedb7e14c572d0cbc6c60f02fc3bb3ed","source_hash":"7737b30cb9d0e16b0d68b08e8de8f27a2fca01db73e5f8636cf9827cc2befe2f","text":"补充规定（政府表彰条例）<2013年1月16日第24314号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1919,"end":1948,"target_id":"c6cbb7e4a4257d8bfc163624ed8be4592648bfb4cd7703c5112c3468a7b272f7","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1948,"end":2068,"target_id":"02100e44753d5f3421f81908a56df82d6b2f5d15a7cca2f1d4d94ec9e31b0004","source_hash":"79e5945e7c4885642ba98f3b7bf67835d7d9a2aa213a11bcd1febc8c01b1a153","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①至⑥ 省略\n\n  ⑦ 《军事嘉奖条例》部分内容修订如下。\n\n  第七条第四款中，“政府表彰条例第十二条的规定”应改为“《政府表彰条例》”。 \n\n  省略⑧至⑫\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2068,"end":2103,"target_id":"e0a6fcf41eae2b9e1aac6db17608f9eee7ca2b537bb845f9a6a44c9cf678959b","source_hash":"82b6a4072b6b57270ca56f300ab1861c2f6c65a75bd900d8c12729289603aa1e","text":"附录（预备役部队法实施令）<第27619号，2016年11月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2103,"end":2140,"target_id":"5aed98fb806ed8965b8389496de6eb390a0397292cdfc63e41018f3d62eae719","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2140,"end":2148,"target_id":"8ce624fb35e28e90cf07be14833c706b18f69f3611bc174702e0d417f56b8129","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2148,"end":2203,"target_id":"31caf13219b365317d6a62d56bda902835ba49763947306a3ed713e5a4119e56","source_hash":"32531a95029a8c1b3043962460af1a72a5d2e7029031fd55247b455546b8a252","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①至⑥ 省略\n\n  ⑦ 《军事嘉奖条例》部分修订如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00030","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2203,"end":2257,"target_id":"c67bf3ef38ec18dcac92ea800fd7a2d8393d373c68af2c3e9b39ae5196fe3e93","source_hash":"61f2a85bf258e7962dfac28de13b75a22961739d1c780c867d93d6a2dad63e59","text":"  第三条中的“国土后备部队成员”应改为“后备部队成员”。\n\n  省略⑧至<17>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00031","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2257,"end":2265,"target_id":"f1fbcbbc5e47356f2e6ebc7df39127f8a5445589667b0b81ed5f8bcbb7008657","source_hash":"bc28291f8a8368cab289540ec155c57b21b6d38387b73664ba08b936ee269006","text":"第 4 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00032","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2265,"end":2309,"target_id":"7c3be957bad46bee365aa19b0226c863643cf1829cda5315a1f6fff176f269d4","source_hash":"549500163550a48b08d2586f925b35088299d2f3a1b0936ab779baf6e5a33b1c","text":"补充规定 <第28297号，2017年9月19日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00033","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003046-248863-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2309,"end":2351,"target_id":"9b03c7505068e296cd87dd87f4b2f66e28cefd5e9c522a31d5281ad100904e3c","source_hash":"57bb4818e9831f1d1a12f9fe0e12b8027dacbd9ec63c5399f5fb84e05214cfc6","text":"补充规定 <第33336号，2023年3月21日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。"}]}